.TH MAZE 1
.SH NAME
maze \- maze editor and solver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/maze
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Maze
is a maze editor and solver.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 draws walls; button 2 solves a path from the clicked cell. The c key clears the grid.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Draw walls
.TP
.B RMB
Solve from cell
.TP
.B c
Clear
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/maze.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
